OL,3,GNEWSAApprentice Boys banned from
OL,4,Amarching along lower Ormeau Road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Parades Commission have imposed
OL,7,Frestrictions on a march by the Belfast
OL,8,FWalker Club, a local branch of the
OL,9,FApprentice Boys of Derry, on the Ormeau
OL,10,FRoad.
OL,12,FThe branch has been told it cannot walk
OL,13,Fdown the mainly nationalist Lower
OL,14,FOrmeau Road.
OL,16,FThe parade is prohibited from crossing
OL,17,FOrmeau Bridge at its junction with the
OL,18,FAnnadale Embankment or from entering
OL,19,Fthat section of Ormeau Road between the
OL,20,Fjunction of Ormeau Bridge and Annadale
OL,21,FEmbankment and the junction of Ormeau
OL,22,FRoad and Havelock Bridge.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
