OL,3,GNEWSAApprentice Boys banned from
OL,4,Amarching along lower Ormeau Road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe commission received submissions
OL,7,Ffrom a number of groups and
OL,8,Findividuals, including the organisers,
OL,9,Fresidents of the Lower Ormeau Road,
OL,10,Fresidents of the wider area, the police
OL,11,Fand political parties.
